{
  "title": "AI Chat: Talk to Your Assistants in the Admin and on Your Website | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Once you have an AI assistant, people need a place to talk to it. The CrestApps AI Chat module gives you a chat page in the admin with a history of your own conversations, a floating chat on every admin page, and a chat box for the visitors of your website, all on top of the same AI profiles.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why every assistant needs a chat, and how the parts fit together\n• Opening a chat, asking follow-up questions and finding past chats\n• The admin chat widget on every admin page\n• Adding the chat widget to your public website with a layer\n• Chat engines: the default orchestrator, Claude and GitHub Copilot\n• Protecting a public assistant with limits, checks and visitor identity\n• Use cases for staff, visitors and editors",
